id: mojo-launch-from-app
section: Keyboard and text
item: Mojo: open a link to the browser from another app (an email or a message): the card shows the page with no keyboard over it
shells: mojo
person: a launch from another app is not emulated (a launch with a target from the command line showed the page with no keyboard, 2026-10-24)
